+// SGSR2-LICENSE.txt next to this file). Changes for the PS2 renderer, marked [ps2x]: the output is the renderer's RGBA8
+// image (rgba8, was rgba16f); the bottom-right neighbour clamped to the image; the uniform block's padding carries the
